192001-58562602-fcfb-4e46-b058-2da6bffe22d4"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"},{"content_hash":"0ea70a76e3d06957fd92a3227e3a31ba3683b22c11536d4572dcb4b83cf14934","event_uuid":"23896fe8-cea6-46fb-ada3-16830554883e","position":{"commit_sha":"ae4fe06dd3490a7a524c83656945f19fe67c27c7","position":"1795251881458995001-23896fe8-cea6-46fb-ada3-16830554883e"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIMQNvvCya66a6YyDlxwkxjjJPN3uaFI+QD3OjyC8e1UF rebar-mac-492a5c71 joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com 20261119"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-311_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"05f74084-8156-4489-b43f-fbb9222cdc20","comments":[],"created_at":1795250996032018001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[],"description":"## Problem\n\n`main` is red at 2e85d8558a4: `tests/unit/test_windows_text_encoding.py::test_no_src_call_decodes_child_output_with_the_locale_codec` flags `src/rebar/_opcert_gate_config.py:61`, a `subprocess.run(..., text=True)` with no `encoding=`. Every change based on current main fails `Verified` on it.\n\n## Cause\n\nTwo changes raced. d5f10d1d2c8 (golden-busied-nag) added the call and passed CI before 37d83e8f308 (dogtired-blank-fieldmouse) added the tree-wide guard that rejects text-mode child output decoded with the locale codec. Each passed CI on its own base; their combination on main does not. Without an explicit encoding, `git show` output (the committed `rebar.toml`) is decoded with the locale code page on Windows, so a non-ASCII byte in that file would fail or mis-decode.\n\n## Fix\n\nAdd `encoding=\"utf-8\"` to that `subprocess.run` call, matching the guard's contract and the rest of `src/rebar`. No other behaviour changes; no new config key, env var or flag.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/rebar/_opcert_gate_config.py`\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] `tests/unit/test_windows_text_encoding.py` passes on the change (it fails on 2e85d8558a4).\n- [ ] `tests/unit/test_opcert_gate_config.py` passes on the change.\n- [ ] `make verify` passes on the change.\n- [ ] The Gerrit change merges with `LLM-Review +1` and `Verified +1`.","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[{"path":"src/rebar/_opcert_gate_config.py","reason":"Add encoding=utf-8 to the read-only git subprocess.run so child output is decoded as UTF-8, not the locale codec"}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"58562602-fcfb-4e46-b058-2da6bffe22d4","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"releases":[],"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"1290-60d3-8e93-44c8","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Op-cert gate config decodes git output with the locale codec","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["daffaceb-0b7d-4769-86bf-329510d98bad","d8c791dc-a6be-434f-9a0a-f9ce2b5be4a1","636abce9-27e4-4f03-b4a0-8dd862cab243","58562602-fcfb-4e46-b058-2da6bffe22d4","23896fe8-cea6-46fb-ada3-16830554883e"]},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1795251881458995002,"uuid":"62493d51-bf3f-46ae-a89a-07f6f72876cd"}